{
  "sections": {
    "gp_section_612315376755147629": {
      "type": "gp-section-612315376755147629",
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "77cf1fb5b24eb477cc17f2a8ab27877f9d2709da172cd6aee35a4c163d8e90da_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg1OaORs0S9_text": "<p>Trusted by 10.000+ VERIFIED CUSTOMERS</p>",
        "ggWAaMCWj6P_text": "Here's What That <span style=\"color:#54B94A;\">Actually Feels Like</span>",
        "ggBhSfUsM9c_text": "<p>My lifts went up and the bloating is gone</p>",
        "ggRTfLXpzf2_text": "<p>\"I switched from powder creatine to FusiForce three months ago. No bloating, no mixing, and my lifts have gone up consistently. My trainer thought I changed my entire program — I just changed the creatine.\"</p>",
        "ggwg67KMTnp_text": "<p>Cathy N</p>",
        "gg-s0IU5w-I_text": "<p>&nbsp;Verified Buyer</p>",
        "gglLOAuO-KR_text": "<p>One spoon in my morning tea changed everything</p>",
        "ggcLLMXUXcg_text": "<p>\"My naturopath recommended Shilajit for energy. I picked ShilaSource because they publish what's inside. One spoon in my morning tea and I'm sharper by 9am than I used to be by noon.\"</p>",
        "ggv1D_01b8L_text": "<p>Sophia R</p>",
        "ggWylZaUe52_text": "<p>&nbsp;Verified Buyer</p>",
        "ggbGz7q4hwA_text": "<p>Easiest part of my 5am routine now</p>",
        "ggXnSGsxFl6_text": "<p>\"I'm a working mom who squeezes workouts in at 5am. FusiForce is the easiest part of my routine — grab two gummies and go. Recovery used to wreck my next day. Not anymore.\"</p>",
        "gg91vmPCdL8_text": "<p>Melissa T</p>",
        "ggsqfsuclNg_text": "<p>&nbsp;Verified Buyer</p>",
        "ggezc2ooLPv_text": "<p>My travel-proof energy solution</p>",
        "ggeHk_mC45P_text": "<p>\"I travel constantly for work and carrying resin jars wasn't realistic. The Shilajit gummies go everywhere with me now. Same energy boost, zero hassle. My colleagues keep asking what changed.\"</p>",
        "gghli9jPxP6_text": "<p>James T</p>",
        "gg5rrUOe_Um_text": "<p>&nbsp;Verified Buyer</p>",
        "gg9CgvJRGNQ_text": "<p>Tried four brands — this is the first one I actually felt</p>",
        "ggPsUYJM78R_text": "<p>\"I've tried four different Shilajit brands over the past two years. ShilaSource is the first one where I felt the difference within two weeks — steady energy, no afternoon crash. The resin is the real deal.\"</p>",
        "ggIrJ6QqsY0_text": "<p>Derek L.</p>",
        "ggI6Y1wFd1h_text": "<p>&nbsp;Verified Buyer</p>",
        "ggfPqLrPR2N_text": "<p>All the benefits without the resin taste</p>",
        "ggUkXmGNYZG_text": "<p>\"I wanted the benefits of Shilajit but couldn't handle the resin taste. These gummies solved that completely. Six weeks in — my focus is better, my energy holds all day, and I actually look forward to taking them.\"</p>",
        "ggYmTstEErO_text": "<p>Amara K</p>",
        "ggqfOV-ENIa_text": "<p>&nbsp;Verified Buyer</p>"
      }
    },
    "gp_section_612315376755213165": {
